	elasticity:
		- stiffness order adds odd exponent to (x-q) (^1, ^3...) and functions are k, K1, K3...
		- damping order adds all exponents from 1 to ord+1 (considering the direction, friction wants to stop the movement), fun are d, D1, D2...
